  "goodToKnow": "Rosten means to rust: Das Auto rostet. The proverb Wer rastet, der rostet (who rests, rusts) means use it or lose it, often said to older people staying active. Der Rost is rust and also a grill or grate: der Grillrost, der Lattenrost (slatted bed base). Rostig means rusty, and rostfrei means stainless: rostfreier Stahl. Perfect with haben or sein: hat/ist gerostet. Note: der Rostbraten is a roast."
